[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/testcontainers/testcontainers-java/issues/comments/612093831","html_url":"https://github.com/testcontainers/testcontainers-java/issues/2431#issuecomment-612093831","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/testcontainers/testcontainers-java/issues/2431","id":612093831,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDYxMjA5MzgzMQ==","user":{"login":"lizardeye","id":31987445,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxOTg3NDQ1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31987445?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lizardeye","html_url":"https://github.com/lizardeye","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lizardeye/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lizardeye/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lizardeye/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lizardeye/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lizardeye/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lizardeye/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lizardeye/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lizardeye/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lizardeye/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2020-04-10T15:56:47Z","updated_at":"2020-04-10T15:56:47Z","body":"Hi, we faced the same issue recently. Cause of the problem was not the testcontainers configuration, but docker itself. \r\nCleaning up all the images and other content helped.\r\n\r\ndocker system prune -af\r\n\r\nP.S. Cleaning only containers didn't help","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/testcontainers/testcontainers-java/issues/comments/612093831/reactions","total_count":13,"+1":11,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":2,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"lizardeye","id":31987445,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxOTg3NDQ1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31987445?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lizardeye","html_url":"https://github.com/lizardeye","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lizardeye/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lizardeye/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lizardeye/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lizardeye/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lizardeye/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lizardeye/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lizardeye/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lizardeye/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lizardeye/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/testcontainers/testcontainers-java/issues/comments/625218639","html_url":"https://github.com/testcontainers/testcontainers-java/issues/2431#issuecomment-625218639","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/testcontainers/testcontainers-java/issues/2431","id":625218639,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDYyNTIxODYzOQ==","user":{"login":"Choobz","id":15648192,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1NjQ4MTky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15648192?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Choobz","html_url":"https://github.com/Choobz","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Choobz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Choobz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Choobz/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Choobz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Choobz/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Choobz/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Choobz/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Choobz/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Choobz/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2020-05-07T12:15:39Z","updated_at":"2020-05-07T12:15:39Z","body":"Hello,\r\n\r\nWe faced the same issue too. The problem seem to be in [LocalImagesCache](https://github.com/testcontainers/testcontainers-java/blob/master/core/src/main/java/org/testcontainers/images/LocalImagesCache.java): \r\n````java\r\n Stream.of(repoTags).collect(Collectors.toMap(\r\n                    DockerImageName::new,\r\n                    it -> ImageData.from(image)\r\n                ))\r\n````\r\nNo distinct is made there and the Collectors.toMap then crash if there's duplicate in repoTags. Since you're not really supposed to have duplicate entries in the registry, that's why pruning get rid of the problem. \r\nWould be great if it didn't crash Test-Containers.\r\n\r\nI got rid of it by overriding the class definition in my application and adding `.distinct()`.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/testcontainers/testcontainers-java/issues/comments/625218639/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"Choobz","id":15648192,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1NjQ4MTky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15648192?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Choobz","html_url":"https://github.com/Choobz","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Choobz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Choobz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Choobz/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Choobz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Choobz/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Choobz/orgs"